{"title":"GrUdge","slug":"GrUdge","pageid":3862,"revid":17565,"timestamp":"2025-03-13T16:32:11Z","lastEditor":"Lynxy69","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"grudge","text":"grUdge"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"grudge\">grUdge</h2>\n<p>grUdge is a pink pig-like animal that has a 1 in 777 (0.129%) chance of spawning when a player opens a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Box_Of_Chocolates/\">Box of Chocolates</a>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>grUdge is the only non-chocolate related item in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Box_Of_Chocolates/\">Box of Chocolates</a><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Rare grUdge from Box Of Chocolate\">Rare grUdge from Box Of Chocolate</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Rare grUdge from Box Of Chocolate</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ul>\n<ul><li>There is a hostile mob version of grUdge that spawns in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a>, which attacks you and inflicts 75 health units. It drops <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F/\">?&#160;?&#160;?</a> after you killed it.</li></ul>\n\n<p><br>\n</p>\n\n</div>"}
